# Frontend Conventions

- Angular 22 standalone components, strict TypeScript
- Angular Material; responsive PWA layouts
- Signal-based state where appropriate; route-level lazy loading
- Reflect server entitlement state — do not gate paid features in browser only
- Accessible forms (ARIA, keyboard, contrast)
- Distinguish draft, shared, and approved snapshot states visually
- Show AI uncertainty clearly; never auto-approve AI suggestions in UI
- i18n-ready strings (English first)
